    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Security and Compliance Officer at we, I can confirm that we has experience delivering solutions to public-sector and health clients, including special-category health data under GDPR Art. 9. we are certified with ISO 27001 since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, ensuring a robust information security management system is in place." ;
