    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, we have implemented measures such as encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we key management is handled on the European Union infrastructure. we also employ pseudonymisation, data minimisation, and configurable retention policies to protect sensitive data. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the SecNumCloud qualification, ensuring that Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud infrastructure meets stringent security standards for hosting sensitive data, including health data. holds aligns with the requirement to host data exclusively within the European Union and not transfer data outside the European Union." ;
