    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explainability and auditability, our product, Atelier, provides features such as source grounding and audit trails, allowing users to understand the elements that led to a particular output. provides is crucial for ensuring transparency in AI-driven decision support systems, especially in healthcare. our are familiar with relevant regulatory frameworks, including CNIL guidance, HDS reference framework, and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare, which helps our ensure that our solutions are consistent with relevant regulatory frameworks, including CNIL guidance, HDS reference framework, and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare. our control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, providing audit evidence where necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
