    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the requirement for explicit validation by a qualified professional for clinical or medico-administrative decisions, our can implement role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging of access and system outputs, ensuring that all actions are traceable and subject to appropriate oversight." ;
